 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you?",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm doing a ten hour overnight coach next week. I need survival tips.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "block": "public_transport.dlg31",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Respect. A neck pillow, an eye mask and earplugs are the holy trinity.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "public_transport.dlg31"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Right, next thing. I've got one empty bed in the backyard and I can't decide what to plant.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.28,
   "block": "gardening.opt1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Could you hear me out on every option before you weigh in?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instruction_v2_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Okay.",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The first idea is tomatoes and peppers, which need a lot of sun and regular watering.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.46,
   "block": "gardening.opt1",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Then there's a herb garden with basil, mint and rosemary, small and easy to keep up.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 4.18,
   "block": "gardening.opt1",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And the last one is wildflowers for the bees, basically no work once they're in the ground.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 6.88,
   "block": "gardening.opt1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Done. Over to you, Moshi.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.08,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_v2_23"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "If that bed gets full sun, tomatoes and peppers would give you the most to eat, but they need daily attention in summer. The herbs are easy and you'll use them all the time in the kitchen. Wildflowers are the lowest effort and great for bees.",
   "est_sec": 14.36,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "gardening.opt1"
  }
 ]
